# CMake Lint Configuration
# Minimal configuration for cmake_linter

# cmake-format aligns wrapped continuation lines (e.g. multi-line elseif()
# conditions) to the opening parenthesis, which is not always an even column.
# That alignment is intentional, correct cmake-format output, so disable
# cmakelint's "indentation must be a multiple of N spaces" check rather than
# fight the formatter.
#
# cmake-format (command_case: canonical) also preserves the officially
# documented MixedCase spelling of module commands such as
# FetchContent_Declare/FetchContent_MakeAvailable, which cmakelint's
# mixed-case check otherwise flags; disable that check too.
filter=-whitespace/indent,-readability/wonkycase
